{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Is Bubsy a celebrated icon from the mascot wars of the early 90s or a platforming punchline? The team at Limited Run Games has built a new collection to find the answer. Bubsy in: The Purrfect Collection explores the franchise's troubled history and enduring popularity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3039890/extras/2913e7dbd62ab5e3b287fce15dfc22a8.poster.avif?t=1757692284\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3039890/extras/2913e7dbd62ab5e3b287fce15dfc22a8.webm?t=1757692284\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bubsy in: The Purrfect Collection is a playable history that includes games, artifacts and interviews. All of the games have been carefully updated for modern platforms using Limited Run\u2019s proprietary Carbon Engine. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3039890/extras/67d6a178eb5d3ffebbc661e8ba33d8ac.poster.avif?t=1757692284\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3039890/extras/67d6a178eb5d3ffebbc661e8ba33d8ac.webm?t=1757692284\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the helm of the project is Audi Sorlie, a producer, author, Bubsy World Heavyweight Champion and arguably the world\u2019s foremost expert on the furry franchise. Together with the team at Limited Run and Atari, he has created the ultimate retrospective celebration of Bubsy, the 3\u20196\u201d tall 80 pound bobcat. What could possibly go wrong?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Included Titles:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Bubsy in: Claws Encounters of the Furred Kind (Super Nintendo Entertainment System\u2122, Super Famicom\u2122, SEGA Genesis\u2122)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Bubsy II (Super Nintendo Entertainment System\u2122, SEGA Genesis\u2122, Game Boy\u2122)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Bubsy in: Fractured Furry Tales (Atari Jaguar\u2122)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Bubsy 3D (PlayStation\u00ae)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3039890/extras/0bf7d57fb8b7e4b837dd575af11f40bc.poster.avif?t=1757692284\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3039890/extras/0bf7d57fb8b7e4b837dd575af11f40bc.webm?t=1757692284\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Enhanced resolution and framerate along with save states and rewind functionality for every game in the collection</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Scans of art, manuals, ads, and more, straight from the top secret Bubsy archives</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Video interviews that delve into the development history of gaming\u2019s most infamous bobcat</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Listen to your favorite tracks in the music player</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3039890/extras/4924e89fd579465a9cd87eaa8f0554f1.poster.avif?t=1757692284\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3039890/extras/4924e89fd579465a9cd87eaa8f0554f1.webm?t=1757692284\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3039890/extras/4924e89fd579465a9cd87eaa8f0554f1.mp4?t=1757692284\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What is the Carbon Engine?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Created internally at Limited Run Games, the Carbon Engine is a development tool that allows legacy content to be ported to modern platforms. It uses emulation as a base, on top of which the Carbon Engine builds features like UI, rendering, audio, data management, controller inputs, and console-specific SDK features like trophies. It allows Limited Run to put out highly accurate, emulation-based ports of classic games for modern hardware. Old, well-loved releases can find a second wind on all-new hardware using the Carbon Engine. It is a core component of Limited Run\u2019s vision for a world that is Forever Physical.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Cat Out On The Town","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3039890/21d4d0740270d16ffd21ed741ce399446146ed46.jpg"},{"name":"When Are They Gonna Open BubsyWorld?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3039890/b253da0ee963b7a8d2dcb3d4b7adf67474bd039d.jpg"},{"name":"The Good, The Bad, and the Bubster","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3039890/35c3a768bad1de688f3dd897cbf81f8fcf2df4ac.jpg"},{"name":"Be Polite, Bub.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3039890/1ebbc09c268068a55be039b5fa505540b87f46f2.jpg"},{"name":"Bubster of the Jungle","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3039890/3b181c99cdd85774d5c8a3e6b718dc3a4d422a33.jpg"},{"name":"Congratulations! You've yarned it!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3039890/5054bd1669066412f0b2604b7ee61dc87add19f6.jpg"},{"name":"Aporklyps Now","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3039890/df2eb078ed1f847c5f55485f96102ce37bc09b55.jpg"},{"name":"A Pig Trouble in Little China","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3039890/02048215cb28fffc0088e5007e9379dc285853ae.jpg"},{"name":"Oinker P. Hamm","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3039890/2d810463c1627d62d88f9f1c80789646a91a893a.jpg"},{"name":"I'm so sorry.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3039890/799b2c0a5e8ec3eb896513bbc32f2f2030df220b.jpg"}],"total":34},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3039890?t=1757692284","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3039890/e721c001249a61aec0af6008f9a5b9c008a9114f/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757692284","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3039890/861e519f1197d3df895941686335440fc0839bff/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757692284","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3039890/861e519f1197d3df895941686335440fc0839bff/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757692284","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Trading Cards","id":29},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Is Bubsy a celebrated icon from the mascot wars of the early 90s or a platforming punchline? The team at Limited Run Games has built a new collection to find the answer. Bubsy i